sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>FE: Isi nama, email, password
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register {name, email, password}
  API->>API: Validasi input (format email, panjang password)
  alt Input tidak valid
    API-->>FE: 400 Bad Request
    FE-->>U: Tampilkan error validasi
  else Input valid
    API->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>API: Hasil pengecekan
    alt Email sudah terdaftar
      API-->>FE: 409 Conflict
      FE-->>U: "Email sudah digunakan"
    else Email tersedia
      API->>API: Hash password (bcrypt)
      API->>DB: INSERT user (role = user)
      DB-->>API: User tersimpan
      API-->>FE: 201 Created
      FE-->>U: Registrasi berhasil, arahkan ke Login
    end
  end
